# Drop reference audio clips in this folder.
# Supported formats: .wav .mp3 .flac .ogg .m4a
#
# The filename (without extension) becomes the voice name.
# Example:
#   voices/narrator.wav   → voice name "narrator"
#   voices/old_man.mp3    → voice name "old_man"
#
# Then use it from the GUI dropdown, CLI (--voice narrator),
# or the API (voice=narrator form field).
